Bhai, Puneet AI TV mein ye sab features honge:

1. TV Home Screen
Purana cluttered home screen clean karna.

Unnecessary apps aur shortcuts hatana.

Ads ko possible limit tak remove karna.

Apna custom AI home screen lagana.

Favorite apps ke shortcuts.

2. AI Assistant
Apna Puneet AI assistant.

Hindi aur English commands samjhega.

Movies aur shows recommend karega.

Questions ke answers dega.

Voice mein jawab dega.

3. WhatsApp Control
WhatsApp se TV control.

Apps open karna.

Volume control.

TV on/off commands.

Dish TV input switch.

Command ka confirmation WhatsApp par.

4. Voice Control
Bina remote TV control.

Voice se apps open karna.

Volume increase/decrease.

Movies search karna.

Channel change karna (supported hardware ke saath).

5. DD Free Dish
Dish TV input control.

Channel change.

Receiver power control.

Channel shortcuts.

6. Laptop Dashboard
TV control panel.

Apps manage karna.

AI commands manage karna.

WhatsApp integration.

Voice settings.

TV connection status.

Automation settings.

7. Smart Features
Favorite movies ki watchlist.

Personalized recommendations.

Scheduled TV on/off (supported devices).

Multiple user profiles.

Smart home integration (future upgrade).

8. Security
Authorized WhatsApp number se commands.

Dashboard login.

Sensitive commands ke liye confirmation.

Original TV software safe rakhna.

Final Vision
Ek clean OnePlus TV + Apna AI + WhatsApp Control + Voice Control + Laptop Dashboard.

Saari commands ek hi AI system se handle hongi. Jo feature TV hardware support nahi karega, uske liye compatible solution dekhenge.




